<p>&nbsp;
<p>
            <center>
                <font size="+2" color=red>
                    God’s Heavy Drop Cloth
                </font>
            </center>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                <p>
                <p>
                God lays a heavy drop cloth<br>
                Loaded with pure whitewash<br>
                Onto our bare, windswept world<br>
                As the raw reality of a harsh<br>
                Horrendous war hangs in the cold<br>
                Cloud covered atmosphere<br>
                Piercing the frigid air with<br>
                Potential terror and much fear!<br>
                <p>
                <p>
                <p>
                <p>
            </blockquote>
